# Project Ideas

## Personal Governance Framework

**Objective:** Build a reusable governance framework for solo development that is cost-free (time only), simple, leverages existing documentation and standards, applies best practices across multiple domains (project management, coding, cybersecurity, testing, architecture, product, data), and provides clear guidance for activities and next steps in technical projects and AI work with defined governance rules and quality standards.

### MVP Milestones

- [ ] Milestone 1: Research and catalog existing standards, frameworks, and best practices across all target domains (project management, coding, cybersecurity, testing, architecture, product, data) to identify reusable components
- [ ] Milestone 2: Create the core governance framework structure with clear rules, standards, and decision trees for each domain area, focusing on simplicity and solo-developer applicability
- [ ] Milestone 3: Build implementation guides and checklists that provide actionable next steps for technical projects and AI initiatives, ensuring the framework is practical and immediately usable

