## All-Around Athlete iPhone App

**Objective:** Build a comprehensive iPhone app for multi-sport athletes that integrates with Garmin for data sync, pushes training schedules to calendar, tracks nutrition (water, calories, food intake including exercise fueling), manages workout schedules (manual, coach, or AI-generated across bike, run, swim, HIIT, mobility, weight lifting, low intensity strength), sets event goals (Ironman, marathon, HYROX, lifting goals), creates repeatable workout routines, and provides performance analytics (sleep, predictions, PRs, goal tracking).

### MVP Milestones

- [ ] Milestone 1: Build core app structure with Garmin integration, calendar sync for training schedules, and basic workout logging for all activity types (bike, run, swim, HIIT, mobility, weight lifting, low intensity strength)
- [ ] Milestone 2: Implement nutrition tracking module (water, calories, food intake with exercise fueling), goal setting with target dates, and workout schedule management (manual entry, coach input, AI generation)
- [ ] Milestone 3: Create performance dashboard with sleep data, performance predictions, personal records tracking, goal progress visualization, and repeatable workout routine library

